{"4443730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ironseed : Lost Chapter", "steam_appid": 4443730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironseed: Lost Chapter is a standalone narrative expansion built using the Ironseed 25th Anniversary Edition engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chapter explores storylines and conversations that were conceived during the development of the original game but never fully implemented. Using original design notes and archived plot fragments, Lost Chapter restores and expands those threads into a complete, playable arc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What This Is</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate, self-contained storyline within the Ironseed universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the original engine and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful to the tone and structure of classic Ironseed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on dialogue, exploration, and narrative progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What This Is Not</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not the story started in Ironseed 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a remake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a graphical overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a modern reimagining</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an authentic extension of the original timeline designed to feel like it could have shipped alongside the original release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Themes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Chapter explores:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation versus sanctuary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom versus containment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequences of intervention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ambiguity of “rescue”</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New alien contacts and story-driven encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully realized side narrative built from unused original lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New log entries and dialogue expansions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional cutscenes and narrative sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded conversation trees across multiple races</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironseed: Lost Chapter is a standalone narrative expansion built using the Ironseed 25th Anniversary Edition engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chapter explores storylines and conversations that were conceived during the development of the original game but never fully implemented. Using original design notes and archived plot fragments, Lost Chapter restores and expands those threads into a complete, playable arc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What This Is</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate, self-contained storyline within the Ironseed universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the original engine and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful to the tone and structure of classic Ironseed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on dialogue, exploration, and narrative progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What This Is Not</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not the story started in Ironseed 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a remake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a graphical overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a modern reimagining</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an authentic extension of the original timeline designed to feel like it could have shipped alongside the original release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Themes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Chapter explores:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation versus sanctuary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom versus containment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequences of intervention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ambiguity of “rescue”</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New alien contacts and story-driven encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully realized side narrative built from unused original lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New log entries and dialogue expansions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional cutscenes and narrative sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded conversation trees across multiple races</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ironseed: Lost Chapter is a standalone side story built on the 25th Anniversary Edition engine. Restored from unused lore and expanded quest fragments, it explores events that were hinted at, but never fully realized, in the original Ironseed timeline.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443730/0ce04f8723e69bb60aa272da0c3adcd39474d3aa/header.jpg?t=1773929741", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443730/7f6a92307f5eb41192228c71cdf7248a9cb994be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773929741", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443730/7f6a92307f5eb41192228c71cdf7248a9cb994be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773929741", "website": "http://ironseed.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st